   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Formal indirect questions",
     "texto": [
      "**Hvorvidt** introduces an indirect question equivalent to «whether» or «to what extent»: **Jeg undersøker hvorvidt studiet passer** («I'm checking whether the programme suits me»). Inside the subordinate clause, the subject comes before the verb.",
      "**Læringsutbytte** is what students are expected to be able to do at the end of a course."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
